\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201440/extras/e93ddcb0ce8ed572f6f6080269f7cf8a.avif?t=1748615713\" data-has-big width=800 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Inventory system has been added in\u00a0this update. It will now provide you with a clear view of the items you possess. This will be especially useful when you need to use specific items to complete quests or overcome obstacles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
